  "headline": "Seven killed and four injured in bus shooting in Homs countryside"
  ,
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "A government source told North Press on September 30, 2026, that seven people were killed and four others were wounded after a bus came under gunfire on the Masyaf Bridge near the Houla area in the western Homs countryside of central Syria. According to the source, the bus was carrying engineers and workers employed by al-Mateen Company at the time of the incident."
